    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "أَشْكَالُ التَّوَاصُلِ الْقَوْلِيِّ",
        "nameEn": "Forms of spoken communication",
        "color": "yellow",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "الْقَوْلُ",
            "en": "the word",
            "ref": "50:29",
            "verse": "مَا يُبَدَّلُ ٱلْقَوْلُ لَدَىَّ وَمَآ أَنَا۠ بِظَلَّـٰمٍۢ لِّلْعَبِيدِ",
            "verseEn": "The word [i.e., decree] will not be changed with Me, and never will I be unjust to the servants.\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "ذِكْرٌ",
            "en": "a reminder",
            "ref": "7:63",
            "verse": "أَوَعَجِبْتُمْ أَن جَآءَكُمْ ذِكْرٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ عَلَىٰ رَجُلٍۢ مِّنكُمْ لِيُنذِرَكُمْ وَلِتَتَّقُوا۟ وَلَعَلَّكُمْ تُرْحَمُونَ",
            "verseEn": "Then do you wonder that there has come to you a reminder from your Lord through a man from among you, that he may warn you and that you may fear Allāh so you might receive mercy?\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "بِالشَّهَادَةِ",
            "en": "the testimony",
            "ref": "5:108",
            "verse": "ذَٰلِكَ أَدْنَىٰٓ أَن يَأْتُوا۟ بِٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ عَلَىٰ وَجْهِهَآ أَوْ يَخَافُوٓا۟ أَن تُرَدَّ أَيْمَـٰنٌۢ بَعْدَ أَيْمَـٰنِهِمْ ۗ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱسْمَعُوا۟ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ",
            "verseEn": "That is more likely that they will give testimony according to its [true] objective, or [at least] they would fear that [other] oaths might be taken after their oaths. And fear Allāh and listen [i.e., obey Him]; and Allāh does not guide the defiantly disobedient people."
          },
          {
            "ar": "نَبَإِ",
            "en": "(the) news",
            "ref": "28:3",
            "verse": "نَتْلُوا۟ عَلَيْكَ مِن نَّبَإِ مُوسَىٰ وَفِرْعَوْنَ بِٱلْحَقِّ لِقَوْمٍۢ يُؤْمِنُونَ",
            "verseEn": "We recite to you from the news of Moses and Pharaoh in truth for a people who believe."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "مَصَائِرُ الآخِرَةِ وَجَزَاؤُهَا",
        "nameEn": "Afterlife Destinations and Recompense",
