            "en": "a punishment",
            "ref": "39:40",
            "verse": "مَن يَأْتِيهِ عَذَابٌۭ يُخْزِيهِ وَيَحِلُّ عَلَيْهِ عَذَابٌۭ مُّقِيمٌ",
            "verseEn": "To whom will come a torment disgracing him and on whom will descend an enduring punishment.\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "النَّعِيمِ",
            "en": "(of) Delight",
            "ref": "68:34",
            "verse": "إِنَّ لِلْمُتَّقِينَ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ جَنَّـٰتِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ",
            "verseEn": "Indeed, for the righteous with their Lord are the Gardens of Pleasure."
          }
        ]
