      {
        "name": "الأَرْزَاقُ وَالأَطْعِمَةُ",
        "nameEn": "Foods and provisions bestowed by Allah",
        "color": "blue",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "لَرِزْقُنَا",
            "en": "(is) surely Our provision",
            "ref": "38:54",
            "verse": "إِنَّ هَـٰذَا لَرِزْقُنَا مَا لَهُۥ مِن نَّفَادٍ",
            "verseEn": "Indeed, this is Our provision; for it there is no depletion."
          },
          {
            "ar": "مَتَاعُ",
            "en": "(is) an enjoyment",
            "ref": "28:60",
            "verse": "وَمَآ أُوتِيتُم مِّن شَىْءٍۢ فَمَتَـٰعُ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَزِينَتُهَا ۚ وَمَا عِندَ ٱللَّهِ خَيْرٌۭ وَأَبْقَىٰٓ ۚ أَفَلَا تَعْقِلُونَ",
            "verseEn": "And whatever thing you [people] have been given - it is [only for] the enjoyment of worldly life and its adornment. And what is with Allāh is better and more lasting; so will you not use reason?"
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْمَنَّ",
            "en": "the Manna",
            "ref": "20:80",
            "verse": "يَـٰبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ قَدْ أَنجَيْنَـٰكُم مِّنْ عَدُوِّكُمْ وَوَٰعَدْنَـٰكُمْ جَانِبَ ٱلطُّورِ ٱلْأَيْمَنَ وَنَزَّلْنَا عَلَيْكُمُ ٱلْمَنَّ وَٱلسَّلْوَىٰ",
            "verseEn": "O Children of Israel, We delivered you from your enemy, and We made an appointment with you at the right side of the mount, and We sent down to you manna and quails,"
          },
          {
            "ar": "فَاكِهَةٍ",
            "en": "fruits",
            "ref": "55:52",
            "verse": "فِيهِمَا مِن كُلِّ فَـٰكِهَةٍۢ زَوْجَانِ",
            "verseEn": "In both of them are of every fruit, two kinds."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "أَلْفَاظُ الْكَذِبِ وَالِافْتِرَاءِ",
        "nameEn": "Words Meaning Falsehood or Fabrication in the Qur'an",
        "color": "purple",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "أَسَاطِيرُ",
            "en": "Stories",
            "ref": "68:15",
            "verse": "إِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِ ءَايَـٰتُنَا قَالَ أَسَـٰطِيرُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ",
            "verseEn": "When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "اِخْتِلَاقٌ",
            "en": "a fabrication",
            "ref": "38:7",
            "verse": "مَا سَمِعْنَا بِهَـٰذَا فِى ٱلْمِلَّةِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ إِنْ هَـٰذَآ إِلَّا ٱخْتِلَـٰقٌ",
            "verseEn": "We have not heard of this in the latest religion. This is not but a fabrication."
          },
          {
            "ar": "كَذِبًا",
            "en": "any lie",
            "ref": "72:5",
            "verse": "وَأَنَّا ظَنَنَّآ أَن لَّن تَقُولَ ٱلْإِنسُ وَٱلْجِنُّ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ كَذِبًۭا",
            "verseEn": "And we had thought that mankind and the jinn would never speak about Allāh a lie."
          },
          {
            "ar": "مُفْتَرًى",
            "en": "invented",
            "ref": "28:36",
            "verse": "فَلَمَّا جَآءَهُم مُّوسَىٰ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ قَالُوا۟ مَا هَـٰذَآ إِلَّا سِحْرٌۭ مُّفْتَرًۭى وَمَا سَمِعْنَا بِهَـٰذَا فِىٓ ءَابَآئِنَا ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ",
            "verseEn": "But when Moses came to them with Our signs as clear evidences, they said, \"This is not except invented magic, and we have not heard of this [religion] among our forefathers.\""
          }
        ]
      }
